config BR2_PACKAGE_SYMREG
	bool "symreg - Microchip switch registers by name"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  Read and write Microchip LAN969x switch registers by symbolic
	  name, and dump the MAC, VLAN, VCAP and stream tables, through
	  the symreg debugfs driver.  Debug aid, root only.  Selected by
	  the Laguna boards, see board/aarch64/microchip-lan969x/README.md

	  https://github.com/microchip-ung/symreg-tool
